      "_comment": "VERB x OBJECT grid for OPENING every card (V2-567). Measured 2026-09-03: «cierra los mensajes» hit this table in 0.08 ms while «cierra los contactos», five seconds later, had no entry, fell to the model, took 3.4 s and OPENED mensajeria — the close only happened because a backstop rescued it. The favourite-restaurant phrases open the contactos CARD on purpose (a favourite IS a directory entry, per its manifest) and the fine-grained view filter stays with the model: the operator's live rows carry favorite=true with empty groups, so a deterministic group filter would answer ZERO.",
